---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Contact | Credits That Count, Louisiana"
  description="Write to Credits That Count, Louisiana's credit transfer checker, at plans@creditsthatcount.com with questions about a result, counselor sign-ups, or deleting your data."
>
  <div class="container">
    <section class="block" style="margin-top:26px;">
      <h1>Contact us</h1>
      <p>
        The fastest way to reach Louisiana's credit transfer checker team is
        email:
        <a href="mailto:plans@creditsthatcount.com">plans@creditsthatcount.com</a>.
        We read every message.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>What to write about</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Questions about a result.</strong> Tell us the colleges
          and courses involved and what you need.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>An error in a result.</strong> Tell us the courses and
          colleges involved and what looks wrong. Error reports are how our
          data gets better.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Counselor seats.</strong> Tell us your organization and
          roughly how many students you serve, or join the
          <a href="/counselors/">counselor list</a> directly.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Deleting your data.</strong> Write from the email address
          you used, with the subject "Delete my data," and we will delete
          your records and confirm by email within 30 days. Our
          <a href="/privacy/">privacy page</a> explains what we keep and
          why.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <p class="tagline-foot">Know before you go.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
